---
import { dudarevOccupationModel } from '../../../data/part02/ch09TeachingModels.mjs';

const samples = Array.from({ length: 241 }, (_, index) => {
  const occupation = index / 240;
  return dudarevOccupationModel({ occupation, additionEnergy: 1, baseCurvature: 2, uEffective: 1 });
});
const xScale = (occupation) => 55 + occupation * 650;
const yScale = (energy) => 240 - energy * 170;
const pathFor = (key) => samples.map((point, index) =>
  `${index === 0 ? 'M' : 'L'} ${xScale(point.occupation).toFixed(2)} ${yScale(point[key]).toFixed(2)}`,
).join(' ');
---

<figure class="chapter-visual dftu-curvature" data-dftu-curvature>
  <figcaption>
    <strong>原创交互模型：fractional occupation、曲率与 Dudarev 型 $U_{\rm eff}$</strong>
    <span lang="en">Original interactive model: fractional occupation, curvature, and Dudarev-type $U_{\rm eff}$</span>
  </figcaption>

  <div class="chapter-visual__controls">
    <label>
      <span>base curvature κ</span>
      <input type="range" min="0" max="4" step="0.1" value="2" data-dftu-kappa />
      <output data-dftu-kappa-output>2.0</output>
    </label>
    <label>
      <span>Ueff</span>
      <input type="range" min="0" max="4" step="0.1" value="1" data-dftu-u />
      <output data-dftu-u-output>1.0</output>
    </label>
    <label>
      <span>occupation f</span>
      <input type="range" min="0" max="1" step="0.02" value="0.5" data-dftu-f />
      <output data-dftu-f-output>0.50</output>
    </label>
  </div>

  <svg viewBox="0 0 760 300" role="img" aria-labelledby="dftu-title dftu-desc">
    <title id="dftu-title">Fractional-occupation energy curvature before and after a Dudarev correction</title>
    <desc id="dftu-desc">A straight line connects the integer endpoints. A convex approximate energy lies below it, while a positive U correction reduces that curvature and can restore linearity when U equals the model curvature.</desc>
    <line x1="55" y1="240" x2="705" y2="240" class="plot-axis" />
    <line x1="55" y1="45" x2="55" y2="240" class="plot-axis" />
    <path d={pathFor('straightLineEnergy')} class="dftu-line dftu-line--straight" data-dftu-straight />
    <path d={pathFor('approximateEnergy')} class="dftu-line dftu-line--base" data-dftu-base />
    <path d={pathFor('correctedEnergy')} class="dftu-line dftu-line--corrected" data-dftu-corrected />
    <circle cx={xScale(0.5)} cy={yScale(dudarevOccupationModel({ occupation: 0.5, additionEnergy: 1, baseCurvature: 2, uEffective: 1 }).correctedEnergy)} r="5" class="dftu-marker" data-dftu-marker />
    <text x="705" y="270" text-anchor="end">occupation f</text>
    <text x="20" y="55">model E(f)</text>
  </svg>

  <ul class="dftu-legend" aria-label="DFT plus U curve legend">
    <li><span class="dftu-key dftu-key--straight"></span>piecewise-linear target</li>
    <li><span class="dftu-key dftu-key--base"></span>approximate convex energy</li>
    <li><span class="dftu-key dftu-key--corrected"></span>with U correction</li>
  </ul>

  <div class="chapter-visual__readout" aria-live="polite">
    <span data-dftu-correction>EU = 0.125000 model energy</span>
    <span data-dftu-potential>VU = 0.000000 model energy</span>
    <strong data-dftu-curvature>corrected curvature = 1.000000</strong>
  </div>

  <div class="chapter-visual__contract">
    <p><strong>模型：</strong>直线目标为 $E_{\rm lin}=\Delta f$。近似能量取 $E_{\rm app}=\Delta f-\kappa f(1-f)/2$，具有正二阶导数 $\kappa$。Dudarev 型修正 $E_U=U_{\rm eff}f(1-f)/2$ 给出 $V_U=U_{\rm eff}(1/2-f)$，使曲率变为 $\kappa-U_{\rm eff}$。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Model:</strong> a convex fractional-occupation error is corrected by $E_U=U_{\rm eff}f(1-f)/2$. The correction potential is $U_{\rm eff}(1/2-f)$ and the model curvature becomes $\kappa-U_{\rm eff}$.</p>
    <p><strong>验收：</strong>整数占据 $f=0,1$ 时修正能为零；$f=1/2$ 时最大；$U_{\rm eff}=\kappa$ 时模型恢复直线；$U_{\rm eff}>\kappa$ 会过度修正并产生相反曲率。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Acceptance:</strong> the correction vanishes at integer occupations, is maximal at one half, restores linearity at $U_{\rm eff}=\kappa$, and overcorrects beyond that point.</p>
    <p><strong>边界：</strong>单一标量占据不表示真实 d/f subspace。真实 DFT+U 依赖 projector、occupation matrix、double-counting、spin、$U/J$ 定义和结构响应；直线化一个模型占据不证明谱、总能或氧化态准确。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Boundary:</strong> one scalar occupation is not a physical correlated subspace. Projectors, occupation matrices, double counting, spin, $U/J$, and structural response remain essential.</p>
  </div>
</figure>

<script>
  import { dudarevOccupationModel } from '../../../data/part02/ch09TeachingModels.mjs';

  document.querySelectorAll('[data-dftu-curvature]').forEach((root) => {
    const kappaInput = root.querySelector('[data-dftu-kappa]');
    const uInput = root.querySelector('[data-dftu-u]');
    const fInput = root.querySelector('[data-dftu-f]');
    const straightPath = root.querySelector('[data-dftu-straight]');
    const basePath = root.querySelector('[data-dftu-base]');
    const correctedPath = root.querySelector('[data-dftu-corrected]');
    const marker = root.querySelector('[data-dftu-marker]');
    if (!(kappaInput instanceof HTMLInputElement) || !(uInput instanceof HTMLInputElement) || !(fInput instanceof HTMLInputElement) || !(straightPath instanceof SVGPathElement) || !(basePath instanceof SVGPathElement) || !(correctedPath instanceof SVGPathElement) || !(marker instanceof SVGCircleElement)) return;

    const xScale = (occupation) => 55 + occupation * 650;
    const yScale = (energy) => 240 - energy * 170;
    const setText = (selector, value) => {
      const element = root.querySelector(selector);
      if (element instanceof HTMLOutputElement) element.value = value;
      else if (element instanceof HTMLElement) element.textContent = value;
    };
    const update = () => {
      const baseCurvature = Number(kappaInput.value);
      const uEffective = Number(uInput.value);
      const occupation = Number(fInput.value);
      const samples = Array.from({ length: 241 }, (_, index) =>
        dudarevOccupationModel({ occupation: index / 240, additionEnergy: 1, baseCurvature, uEffective }),
      );
      const pathFor = (key) => samples.map((point, index) =>
        `${index === 0 ? 'M' : 'L'} ${xScale(point.occupation).toFixed(2)} ${yScale(point[key]).toFixed(2)}`,
      ).join(' ');
      straightPath.setAttribute('d', pathFor('straightLineEnergy'));
      basePath.setAttribute('d', pathFor('approximateEnergy'));
      correctedPath.setAttribute('d', pathFor('correctedEnergy'));
      const probe = dudarevOccupationModel({ occupation, additionEnergy: 1, baseCurvature, uEffective });
      marker.setAttribute('cx', xScale(occupation).toFixed(2));
      marker.setAttribute('cy', yScale(probe.correctedEnergy).toFixed(2));
      setText('[data-dftu-kappa-output]', baseCurvature.toFixed(1));
      setText('[data-dftu-u-output]', uEffective.toFixed(1));
      setText('[data-dftu-f-output]', occupation.toFixed(2));
      setText('[data-dftu-correction]', `EU = ${probe.correctionEnergy.toFixed(6)} model energy`);
      setText('[data-dftu-potential]', `VU = ${probe.correctionPotential.toFixed(6)} model energy`);
      setText('[data-dftu-curvature]', `corrected curvature = ${probe.correctedCurvature.toFixed(6)}`);
    };
    kappaInput.addEventListener('input', update);
    uInput.addEventListener('input', update);
    fInput.addEventListener('input', update);
    update();
  });
</script>

<style>
  .dftu-curvature svg { width: 100%; max-height: 23rem; }
  .dftu-curvature text { fill: currentColor; font-size: 14px; }
  .dftu-line { fill: none; stroke-width: 3; }
  .dftu-line--straight { stroke: var(--sl-color-gray-3); stroke-dasharray: 8 5; }
  .dftu-line--base { stroke: var(--sl-color-text-accent); }
  .dftu-line--corrected { stroke: var(--sl-color-accent-high); }
  .dftu-marker { fill: var(--sl-color-accent-high); stroke: var(--sl-color-bg); stroke-width: 2; }
  .dftu-legend { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem 1rem; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
  .dftu-key { display: inline-block; width: 1.8rem; margin-right: 0.35rem; border-top: 3px solid currentColor; vertical-align: middle; }
  .dftu-key--straight { color: var(--sl-color-gray-3); border-top-style: dashed; }
  .dftu-key--base { color: var(--sl-color-text-accent); }
  .dftu-key--corrected { color: var(--sl-color-accent-high); }
</style>
